{\"changes\":[{\"timestamp\":\"$D2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"markdown\",{\"id\":\"2026-07-08\",\"content\":\"\u003c!--\\nBRIEF\\nExplore the HackMD Community\\n--\u003e\\nHackMD Community\\n-----------------------\\n![CommunityAnnouncement_HackMD](https://hackmd.io/_uploads/HyTu10imGg.jpg =400x)\\n\\nPublished notes now appear in the HackMD Community, a shared space where public notes are discoverable by topic. Publishing a note sets its Read permission to Everyone (your original setting is restored if you unpublish), while Write permission always stays as you configured it. Notes in Public teams are published by default; switching the team to Private unpublishes them.\"}]]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2026-05-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"markdown\",{\"id\":\"2026-05-18\",\"content\":\"\u003c!--\\nBRIEF\\nPDF export experience has been improved\\n--\u003e\\nImproved PDF Export\\n-----------------------\\n![PDF_Export_Improved (1)](https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Sy_yq0_yfg.jpg =400x)\\n\\nPDF export is now more reliable and easier to control. Use a dedicated export page to review settings, start conversion, and download with more confidence, with improvements to output quality for layouts, tables, images, and rendered content like LaTeX and UML.\"}]]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2026-05-11T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"markdown\",{\"id\":\"2026-05-11\",\"content\":\"\u003c!--\\nBRIEF\\nUploade bulk md files to overview\\n--\u003e\\nUpload Markdown Files to Overview\\n-----------------------\\n![Upload_MD_HackMD](https://hackmd.io/_uploads/Bk6-_bSpWx.jpg =400x)\\nYou can now bring Markdown content into HackMD more easily from Overview. Upload one or multiple Markdown files at once, move existing notes into HackMD faster, and keep working with the file formats you already use.\"}]]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"markdown\",{\"id\":\"2025-10-27\",\"content\":\"\u003c!--\\nBRIEF\\nEasily share links to other users\\n--\u003e\\nInvite Collaborators Instantly with Shareable Links \\n-----------------------\\n![shareable_links](https://hackmd.io/_uploads/B1MWSuyJMl.jpg =400x)\\n\\nNow you can generate a secure, customizable link to invite anyone directly. Set permissions like read-only or full-edit access, add an expiration date, and even limit how many times the link can be used.\"}]]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-09-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"markdown\",{\"id\":\"2025-09-23\",\"content\":\"\u003c!--\\nBRIEF\\nManage Tags in Bulk from the Sidebar\\n--\u003e\\nImproved Tag Management\\n-----------------------\\n![Improved_Tags](https://hackmd.io/_uploads/S1rGNuk1Mg.jpg =400x)\\nOrganize your notes faster than ever. You can now create, rename, and delete tags directly from the Overview sidebar. Select multiple notes to add or remove tags in a single action, streamlining how you categorize knowledge.\"}]]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-09-04T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"markdown\",{\"id\":\"2025-09-04\",\"content\":\"\u003c!--\\nBRIEF\\nYour new profile: The business card for your expertise.\\n--\u003e\\nProfile Overhaul: Pin Notes, Categories \u0026 Connections\\n----------------\\n![Profile feature image](https://hackmd.io/_uploads/BJhdTu1nlx.png =400x)\\nWe've completely overhauled profiles. Showcase your best work by pinning notes, organize content with categories, and add your social links (Email, Telegram, Discord, X). Improved sharing helps your knowledge reach a wider audience.\"}]]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-08-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[\"$L26\"]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-07-08T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[\"$L27\"]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-05-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[\"$L28\"]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-05-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[\"$L29\"]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-04-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[\"$L2a\"]},{\"timestamp\":\"$D2025-04-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"content\":[\"$L2b\"]},{\"timestamp